1
00:00:00,746 --> 00:00:03,906
(Penny:)Obviously,
I have some commitment issues.

2
00:00:04,116 --> 00:00:07,776
- Glaringly obvious. Go on.
- As long as things keep going great...

3
00:00:07,987 --> 00:00:11,427
(Penny:)...you'll keep asking me to marry you.
Eventually, I'll end up saying yes.

4
00:00:11,624 --> 00:00:15,614
(Penny:)Then we're gonna be married forever
and the whole thing just freaks me out.

5
00:00:17,563 --> 00:00:19,223
(Leonard:)Okay.

6
00:00:19,899 --> 00:00:22,599
(Leonard:)I know I propose a lot.

7
00:00:26,572 --> 00:00:29,062
(Leonard:)So how about this?

8
00:00:29,742 --> 00:00:33,142
(Leonard:)I promise I will never ask you
to marry me again.

9
00:00:33,913 --> 00:00:36,573
(Penny:)What do you mean?
Are you breaking up with me?

10
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:38,152
(Leonard:)No. No, no, no.

11
00:00:38,351 --> 00:00:41,481
(Leonard:)But if someday, you decide
you wanna get married...

12
00:00:41,721 --> 00:00:43,591
(Leonard:)...you have to propose to me.

13
00:00:44,256 --> 00:00:45,656
- Really?
- Yes.

14
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:47,958
(Leonard:)It's all on you.

15
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,860
But when the time comes,
I want the whole nine yards.

16
00:00:51,097 --> 00:00:54,587
(Leonard:)I want you down on one knee, flowers.
I wanna be swept off my feet.

17
00:00:57,103 --> 00:00:58,233
(Penny:)Yeah, you got it.

18
00:00:58,437 --> 00:01:02,027
(Leonard:)And I'm cool with surprises,
but nothing on a Jumbotron.

